  "description": "Thirty-year-old Tae-Gyu Lee has been drifting through life, numb and unable to feel the highs and lows of emotion. Everything changes when a mysterious old man gives him the power to copy other people’s feelings through a strange spirit flame. But what begins as an unusual new ability soon pulls Tae-Gyu into the orbit of drama writer In-Ho Gwak , sending his life in a direction he never expected. As his world begins to shift, Tae-Gyu finds himself stepping toward an entirely new path as an actor.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
